#: 73dce1505a614e88a0b58f1ac24fcafe
msgid "重训后用含空位的测试集推理，力 MAE 应对空位近邻原子也有合理精度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:38
#: ebb66e2816f5458eb971fcb1ef950bc3
msgid "如果低浓度 OK 但高浓度崩，说明训练集高浓度样本不够——增加 `concentration_condition`"
msgstr ""

