#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:43
#: 8c769b4a05474dd58cfeb592407d3c5c
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:44
#: f3636730029746efaac583eb2a68f25e
msgid "需要快速覆盖\"少了一个原子\"对力/能量的影响"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:45
#: 1a5cdc1049f846c9b899e20768ce8804
msgid "训练集只有完美晶体，需要低/中/高缺陷密度梯度"
