#: c4f831069a8e41c594efaadb88b6aaf7
msgid "Num Condition（num_condition）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:58
#: 2157f1741114485d86e3f95dea6619f4
msgid "`int`，默认 1。count 模式下的空位数量，范围 1-8。直接指定每个结构删几个原子——适合你已经想好确切数字的场景。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:60
#: 862bb7d046d0464ebbc900886cf220b0
msgid "Use Num（use_num）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:62
#: 46b72d7903444868a27960999e62153f
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开时按绝对空位数删除，不同输入的缺陷数始终保持一致；关掉后切到浓度模式，不同超胞尺寸下自动保持相同缺陷比例。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:64
#: 535ce26a787f43d195f033032299580d
msgid "Concentration Condition（concentration_condition）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:66
#: a318505be0834e78b7d9cee048c14f6d
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0。fraction 模式下的空位比例，如 0.02 约等于删掉 2% 的原子。推荐范围 "
"0.005-0.08。比例太小可能一个原子都删不到，比例太大结构容易崩。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:68
#: 031925daef374cca8291b6c51284b8e0
msgid "Count Mode（count_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:70
#: 9590f559a7db490180aef84926740b70
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `fixed`。`fixed` 精确按住上面设置的数量删；`random` 在 1 "
"到设定值之间随机。你需要固定空位数量做对照实验就选 fixed，想覆盖更多空位分布的多样性就选 random。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:72
#: e79877cd37364896b0a3fc44e7901b29
msgid "采样和预算"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:74
#: 6ce18ccd34944def9e28a737eff25b2d
msgid "Engine Type（engine_type）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:76
#: f017e0d2b0b34666becada705dc93e23
msgid "`int`，默认 1。`0` = Sobol 准随机序列，`1` = Uniform 均匀随机。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:78
#: 5bf18451347d41468d3710920c3c22c4
msgid "样本少时 Sobol 对空位数量和位置的覆盖更均衡；大批量（100+）时两者差异很小，Uniform 更快。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:80
#: 722fe70a69714617a14328d2c447a2b1
msgid "Max Structures（max_structures）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:82
#: 39852349d7d54b76a89d5fcd358f2352
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每输入帧生成多少个空位版本。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:84
#: 3e59387716e84092a1d0ddaabc3c5378
msgid "10~50 够轻量补样，50~100 做常规覆盖，上了 100 建议接一张 `FPS Filter`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:86
#: dcb22d04126b46b18932874da7106f8e
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:88
#: 39f0070a0b2c4fdd98d3da94d5cef860
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定 seed → 同参同输入可复现。需要对比实验时开着，纯探索可以关。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:90
#: a8dad60b37794e1486680ae5f0136fa6
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:92
#: 31708afd7bb34a16bd06e7c36e23c0ce
msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:94
#: cb1964b4bd304871a7f19aac07a34462
