msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:164
#: db2b4565bafe44739e5beda9e5378296
msgid ""
"**count 和 fraction 怎么选。** 二者只选一个：想精确删几个原子用 `Vacancy Count`；想按体系大小等比例删用 "
"`Vacancy Fraction`。"
msgstr ""

